  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the raclette-grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the ferment-jang, lemon juice, and olive oil.",
    "Slice the haggis into 1-inch pieces and place on the grill.",
    "Cook for 2-3 minutes per side, or until the edges are slightly charred.",
    "Meanwhile, heat the olive oil in a pan over medium heat and saut\u00191 the onion and garlic until softened.",
    "Add the cooked haggis to the pan and stir in the ferment-jang mixture.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the haggis hot, garnished with chopped parsley.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve immediately."
